L5-PWR: LAYER 5'S POWER PASS, READ BACK (MESHSAT-1357, set 27, 3 October 2026). Prototype design: nothing built, powered or
measured; this is a check of the contracts' text against the Layer 4 records' text. Marks: MAKER (a maker's printed row),
INFERRED, MODELED, PROVISIONAL (an open condition, its trigger named), RULE (a session rule), TEST (a bench row), NETLIST;
DRAFTED (R-nn): true of a release-guarded Layer 4 draft that no generator carries yet.

